= {!<span class="term term-religious">!}Ayatollah Abol-Qasem Kashani{!</span>!}

Kashani is an independent political counterpart with his own constituency and
objectives—not a subordinate member of the Front's staff. Cooperation can
mobilize religious and bazaar networks without dissolving that independence.

